<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>
  <!--
    Optional, off by default: the spacer tier setting rebuilds the Toxin as one of VFEP's 10th
    generation (spacer) sets, beside the Siegebreaker, instead of a 7th-gen set beside the Hazard.
    PatchOperationSetting reads the setting while the patches apply, so a change waits for a
    restart; the descriptions move with it from Keyed strings (ToxinWarcasketSettings
    .ApplySpacerText), since a patched description would be put back by every language's
    DefInjected text but English's. The def headers stay the record of the 7th-gen defaults;
    this header is the record of the spacer values. Nothing marks a VFEP def as spacer tier;
    the tier is the bundle below, each entry the spacer sets' shared value (VFEP v3.09,
    Apparel_Various.xml / Apparel_Headgear.xml) unless said otherwise:
    - Plating Sharp 2 / Blunt 1 / Heat 1 in every piece (the Siegebreaker's, the Controller's
      and the Sarcophagus's; the Guardian and Brute take Blunt 1.5 as their specialty).
    - Mass 50 / 20 / 8 and no MoveSpeed offset: the tier's frames carry no speed penalty at
      all. Insulation 80/80, 22/22, 5/2.
    - ToxicResistance +0.5 and PsychicSensitivity -0.5 on armor and helmet, every spacer set's
      pair, so the set is immune to direct toxins as its peers are; the 7th-gen split from the
      Hazard (environment only) does not apply at a tier the Hazard is not in. The gas-specific
      ToxicEnvironmentResistance stays as it is.
    - Shield bubble on the armor, the tier's comp block verbatim: the tier's baseline of
      EnergyShieldEnergyMax 1.5 (150 energy) and EnergyShieldRechargeRate 0.01 (the Guardian's,
      Controller's and Sarcophagus's; the Siegebreaker's 2.5 and the Brute's 5 are their
      specialties). VEF's CompShieldBubble reads both stats off the armor itself, blocks ranged
      and explosive hits only, and lets the wearer shoot (and jet) through it.
    - VacuumResistance under Odyssey, from ToxinVacuumResistance.xml: its gate
      (ToxinWarcasketSettings.ToxinVacuumActive) holds while this setting is on, so the tier
      carries the stat without a second copy of the values here.
    - Research VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets (6000, Spacer) in place of VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets;
      Biotech's ToxGas stays. Tag WarcasketVeteran in place of WarcasketSpecialised: the
      spacer sets' tag, which puts the set on both VFEP factions' veteran raiders and Odyssey's
      salvagers beside the Marine, Recon and spacer sets, where the 7th-gen tag reaches no pawn
      kind at all.
    - Costs in the tier's band, spacer components and plasteel with no steel, the chemfuel on
      top as the def headers set it: armor ComponentSpacer 6, Plasteel 150, Uranium 50;
      shoulders 2 / 60; helmet 4 / 60. The armor's 6 is the tier's standard (the Brute's 4 and
      the Controller's 12 are its dial), the shoulders' 2 the Controller shoulders' price for
      a verb, the helmet's 4 the Controller's and Brute's for a helmet with a function of its
      own. Plasteel at the utility sets' 145 to 150 / 60 / 60, never under the tier's floor.
      The set is about 5250 silver at market value, over the Guardian and Brute and under the
      Controller, as a kit set beside the Siegebreaker's 4195.

    Insulation_Cold on the armor and helmet is replaced only where it is not already 100:
    SOS2Patch.xml sets 100 on both under Save Our Ship 2, and patch files within a mod apply in
    filesystem order, so neither file may depend on running after the other.

    Under Combat Extended, CombatExtended.xml owns the plating (Sharp and Blunt), the shield
    stats and the costs of both tiers, in CE's units, so the block at the end applies this
    file's versions of exactly those only without CE: the two files then never touch the same
    node and apply in either order. Heat is not a CE value and stays above with the rest.
  -->
  <Operation Class="ToxinWarcasket.PatchOperationSetting">
    <setting>spacerTier</setting>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <!-- Heat plating and speed, every piece (Sharp and Blunt are in the block at the end). -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Heat</xpath>
          <value>
            <ArmorRating_Heat>1</ArmorRating_Heat>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets/MoveSpeed</xpath>
        </li>

        <!-- Research and tags, every piece. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/researchPrerequisites/li[text() = "VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <li>VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets</li>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/apparel/tags/li[text() = "WarcasketSpecialised"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <li>WarcasketVeteran</li>
          </value>
        </li>

        <!-- Armor: frame, insulation, shield comp, resistances. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases/Mass</xpath>
          <value>
            <Mass>50</Mass>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases/Insulation_Cold[. != "100"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <Insulation_Cold>80</Insulation_Cold>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases/Insulation_Heat</xpath>
          <value>
            <Insulation_Heat>80</Insulation_Heat>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets</xpath>
          <value>
            <PsychicSensitivity>-0.5</PsychicSensitivity>
            <ToxicResistance>0.5</ToxicResistance>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/comps</xpath>
          <value>
            <li Class="VEF.Apparels.CompProperties_ShieldBubble">
              <compClass>VEF.Apparels.CompShieldBubble</compClass>
              <blockRangedAttack>true</blockRangedAttack>
              <blockMeleeAttack>false</blockMeleeAttack>
              <showWhenDrafted>true</showWhenDrafted>
              <showOnHostiles>true</showOnHostiles>
              <showOnNeutralInCombat>true</showOnNeutralInCombat>
              <shieldTexPath>Other/ShieldBubble</shieldTexPath>
              <chargeFullyWhenMade>true</chargeFullyWhenMade>
              <minShieldSize>2.1</minShieldSize>
              <maxShieldSize>2.7</maxShieldSize>
              <disableRotation>true</disableRotation>
            </li>
          </value>
        </li>

        <!-- Shoulders: frame, insulation. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/Mass</xpath>
          <value>
            <Mass>20</Mass>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/Insulation_Cold</xpath>
          <value>
            <Insulation_Cold>22</Insulation_Cold>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/Insulation_Heat</xpath>
          <value>
            <Insulation_Heat>22</Insulation_Heat>
          </value>
        </li>

        <!-- Helmet: insulation. -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/Insulation_Cold[. != "100"]</xpath>
          <value>
            <Insulation_Cold>5</Insulation_Cold>
          </value>
        </li>

        <!-- Without Combat Extended: plating, shield stats and costs. CombatExtended.xml sets
             its own in CE's units for both tiers and never touches anything else here. -->
        <li Class="ToxinWarcasket.PatchOperationModActive">
          <packageIds>
            <li>ceteam.combatextended</li>
          </packageIds>
          <nomatch Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Sharp</xpath>
                <value>
                  <ArmorRating_Sharp>2</ArmorRating_Sharp>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Blunt</xpath>
                <value>
                  <ArmorRating_Blunt>1</ArmorRating_Blunt>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
                <value>
                  <EnergyShieldRechargeRate>0.01</EnergyShieldRechargeRate>
                  <EnergyShieldEnergyMax>1.5</EnergyShieldEnergyMax>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <ComponentSpacer>6</ComponentSpacer>
                    <Plasteel>150</Plasteel>
                    <Uranium>50</Uranium>
                    <Chemfuel>30</Chemfuel>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <ComponentSpacer>2</ComponentSpacer>
                    <Plasteel>60</Plasteel>
                    <Chemfuel>15</Chemfuel>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
                <value>
                  <costList>
                    <ComponentSpacer>4</ComponentSpacer>
                    <Plasteel>60</Plasteel>
                    <Chemfuel>10</Chemfuel>
                  </costList>
                </value>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </nomatch>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
